# Docker Compose Full-Stack Chore

This commit sets up Docker Compose orchestration for the full-stack application:
- Created docker-compose.yml at project root (version 3.9)
- Configured frontend service:
  - Builds from frontend/Dockerfile
  - Exposes port 8080:80
  - Sets VITE_API_URL=http://backend:3000 for internal communication
  - Joins app-network for service discovery
  - Restart policy: unless-stopped
  
- Configured backend service:
  - Builds from backend/Dockerfile  
  - Exposes port 3000:3000
  - Volume mount: ./backend/logs:/app/logs for persistence
  - Joins app-network for service discovery
  - Health checks enabled (verifies /api/demo)
  - Restart policy: unless-stopped

- Custom bridge network: app-network
  - Enables service-to-service communication
  - Frontend can call backend at http://backend:3000
  - Isolated from host network for security

Files created:
- docker-compose.yml (at root, orchestration config)
